<title>JAPAN: Mitsui &amp; Co - 6 month parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsui &amp; Co - 6 month parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.21 trln	 vs	    7.12 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   14.80		vs	   13.91</p>
<p> Current	     29.46		vs	   26.36</p>
<p> Net		   12.61		vs	   10.58</p>
<p> EPS		    8.11 yen	  vs	    6.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares		 1.56 billion    vs	    1.55 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsui &amp; Co Ltd is a major trading company.</p>
